{"text": "等一下,我问老板能不能免运费。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "老板说,赔偿一百块。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你说的优惠券,我们这里没有。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那么我们先退款,再重新发货。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货会晚到,但是我们会优先安排。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递变慢了是因为下雨,我们不赔钱哦。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这样吧,送你两个礼物。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给您加急处理,明天中午前一定到。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你不是说要退款吗?我们已经退了。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的飞机快递,很快就好。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快一点的快递,你要自己付钱。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不好意思,退款要七天。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "7_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "订单已经加急,你放心。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我给你的免运费券,下次买东西可以用。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "赔钱没问题,但是要先收到货。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,我们先说一下,优先发货是不可以的。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,请问你的订单是哪一个?", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们这边查了,快递在海关。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货不是我们压着的,是仓库的问题。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这周五你能收到。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我周一给你发,可以?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您需要几号到货?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没有问题,我们照你说的办。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好的好的。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退钱这个事情,我们真的做不到。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不好意思,让你不开心了。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们一定会解决,您先别急。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起,我们疏忽了,责任在我们。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个价格不能打折了。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你要的折扣,我给你百分之二十。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 20}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "减一半,最低了。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 50}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "总是不好意思,今天就补发。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们会重新寄一个,放心。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免运费加九折,够诚意吧。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 10}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "空运,是的,我想帮你做空运。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "想快一点?那我们用另外一个快递。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们可以优先安排你的货,不过要等明天。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这件事我们公司不能赔偿,真的对不起。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢你告诉我,我马上看。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "等你的货到了,请给我们评价,谢谢。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的朋友说你没收到,对吗?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "昨天你说你要退款,今天我们再讨论。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递车坏了,所以晚了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的错,请你再给一次机会。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我先送你一张券,补发的快递加急。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你先别生气,我们送你免运费。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不用担心,加急费我出。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我想退款给你,可是系统不让。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "别的我不知道,但是我们已经加急了。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天早上我们已经发货了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退一半钱可以吗,请问?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你想要礼物,还是想要优惠券?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "补偿一事,我们回去商量。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没有,我们没有什么礼物给你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您的货物,优先处理,三天内到。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "要是你早一点说,我们就可以加急了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果货到了,但是坏了,我们就赔偿。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那个,运费我们不要你的。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "公司说可以赔,但是只有一点点。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这么晚到,我们没想到,抱歉。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "加急的单子很多,你的也在里面。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这批货在工厂,还没有做好。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不加急,因为你不是急用。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "还可以退货退款,七天内。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "嗯,我们的快递员迷路了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你可以再等一天吗?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我送你礼物,我送你礼物,你别投诉。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们把钱退回你的银行卡。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个订单我们特别处理,先发。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给你赔不是,还送你一个小礼品。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "补偿的话,我们可以给你下一单免邮。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免邮是可以的,但是加急就不行了。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我是不是应该给你赔偿呢?我觉得应该。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "自问自答,赞同赔偿"}
{"text": "赔你钱?我们公司从来不这样。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不是不想快,是飞机没有位子。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "空运的位子今天还有,我帮你订。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "别的快递公司更快,我给你换。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的包裹我们特快专递寄。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们已经把你放在优先名单里了。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "提前发货这个事情,我可以做。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "赶快发出去,我现在去仓库。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我会让快递员今天晚上一定送。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天加班也要给你发出去。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你不要生气,我给你返现十块。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个钱我们返还给你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你收到以后,我们再给你一张优惠券。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们补一个赠品给你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉,送你赠品,表示我们的诚意。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "包邮,下次包邮,这次也包邮。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退款手续费我们出。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你要多少赔偿,你说一个数字。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的赔偿政策是三倍。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没有,我们没有赔偿政策。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "抱歉,今天不能加急,明天才可以。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "想要加急的话,需要多付钱。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递慢一点,可是便宜一点。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "三天内的快递,我们保证。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "订单是周一下的,对吧?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你那边是谁收货?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的责任,我们承担,对不起。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "工厂的人今天生病了,所以没做完。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "factory"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "台风来了,飞机也停了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好吧,你说得对,我们补发。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "行,按你的意思,退款。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这不是我的错,是快递公司。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "哎呀,太晚了,真对不起。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们给你折扣,百分之三十。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 30}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "七折,这是老板给的最大折扣。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 30}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不能打折,但是可以送礼物。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "就这样,谢谢你,再见。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,有一个问题,我想跟你说。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你说的快递单号,我们没有收到。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们周日发货,下周三到。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "sunday"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "wednesday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "周三,不对,是周四,货到你那里。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "thursday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,我发加急给你,别生气。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "有人说我们不赔偿,这个是错的,我们赔。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们想办法让它快点到你手里。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请把收货地址再发一次。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好,我是店里的小李。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这批货在仓库里堵了三天。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的钱,三个工作日就到账。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我给你换个更快的物流,这次不收钱。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不退钱,可以换货。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "老板同意免运费了。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的单子我提到最前面。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的飞机货,明天一早到。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快一点,快一点,我告诉仓库。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个季节,空运不一定有位置。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我不能给你加急,因为已经发出了。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "现在加急没有用了,货已经到你的城市。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退款已经批准,请看短信。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你不要担心钱,我们会还给你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "赔偿金额我们还在算。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们公司也给过别人礼物,可是你的没有。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起,送礼物这个我不可以决定。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "有个优惠,只有今天,你想要吗?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起,优惠券今天用完了。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退一点钱给你,您觉得呢?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "加急的服务,我们免费做,免费。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "加急免费"}
{"text": "你的快递,我们帮你升级到次日达。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我说的优先,是比别人先发。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天不发,不是因为不想,是系统坏了。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我问问仓库,能不能马上发。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个包裹周六能不能到,我不知道。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "是,是,是,我们明白了。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "是我们的问题,我们补偿你,放心。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不是想不赔,是想先查清楚。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "没有明确给或拒绝补偿"}
{"text": "您是说我们不想退款?不是这样的,我们愿意退。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "他们说加急,可是我没有看到。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢您等我们,我们今天重新发。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快点快点,我催快递公司了。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你要不要礼物?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢,我们会改进的,祝你顺利。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们三天内一定到,不到就退款。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "客人你好,货有点问题。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货在清关,清关很慢。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "能不能取消订单,我退钱?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这件衣服没有货,新的下周做。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们道歉,我们赔钱,还免运费。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请你收下我们的歉意和一份礼物。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这次我们负责所有的运费。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你再下一单,我们给你送一份礼物。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不加价,可是需要加急费。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "走空运不好吗?比海运快很多。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的快递不是不快,是你的地址太远。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "半价,最多半价。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 50}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "再便宜我们就亏了,不能打折。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你想几号收到,告诉我。", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "货什么时候急用?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起,我们真的没办法再快了。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个要求,公司规定不允许。", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "实在不行,我们也没办法。", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你说我们骗你,我们没有骗你。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "是物流延误,不关我们的事。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好,你要退货,我们同意。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没问题,你想要加急,我就加急。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "可以可以,免运费,我同意。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对不起,下次一定准时。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天一定重新发货,明天到。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们马上补发,三天内到你手里。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "再见,祝你有个好周末。", "frames": [{"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的耐心,我们很感谢。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我给你一张满减券,下单能用。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退款或者换货,你选一个。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "resend", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这是我们送你的小心意。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免运费是真的,不骗你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你想要免运费的话,下个订单可以。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们退款,再加一点补偿给你。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "钱已经原路退回,请你查收一下。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "公司不允许我们送礼物。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "想要补偿,可能要等主管回来。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不给补偿,因为你已经收到货了。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免费加急?这个我们真的没有。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "加急单我们周一到周五才做。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的货在加急通道里面。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们改成最快的方式,你放心。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今晚就用空运送去,明天上午到。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "请你不要取消,我会优先处理的。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是不可以加急,是需要时间。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "没有明确提供也没有拒绝"}
{"text": "我们快递也想快啊,但是没有办法。", "frames": [{"act": "refuse", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不好意思,我们的快递不能再快了。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的快递员已经在你家楼下。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "打九五折,再送你一个小东西。", "frames": [{"act": "discount", "pol": "+", "pct": 5}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的朋友买了就送礼物,你为什么不要?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的东西卖得便宜,所以没有赔偿。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你说没收到钱,我们看一下。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "有一些事情,我想解释。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们看了,货在中转站。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "logistics"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果你今天下单,我们明天就发。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "只要你不生气,我就给你退一半。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "您好,谢谢您的理解,我们会加急。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "谢谢,谢谢,我们一定尽快。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "快递二到三天,不是二十天,你看错了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你要退款,我这边没有收到你的申请。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们会给你一个更好的快递服务。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "订单我看了,没有加急的记录。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免运费劵你收到了吗?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我想问一下,你的订单编号是什么?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_order", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "亲,你好,货慢了,请见谅。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "海关最近检查很严,我们也没办法。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "customs"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们不对,没有及时通知你。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们昨天已经发了,不是没发。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "好,我们今天晚上发出去。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "today"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "三天以后你就可以收到货。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "3_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "下星期一应该到,应该。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "monday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "非常感谢,后会有期。", "frames": [{"act": "thanks", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "closing", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们加急的话,会不会有问题?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "空运,我们是有,不过货太大,不能走。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这次我送你快递保险,免费的。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的订单,我们升级为优先订单。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的加急服务是收费的,不是免费。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "收费服务,不提供免费加急"}
{"text": "只要你满意,我们就加急处理。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不用赔偿,你要的话我们就给。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你要的是退款还是补偿?这个我要问。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们补偿你十块钱的话费。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,退款的话,请你先退货。", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "给你退款,可是你要等十天。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "10_days"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "退款我们走流程,可能很慢,抱歉。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免费的礼物我们不给,是你自己买。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你想要加急,但是我们的仓库放假了。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "other"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "如果你要空运,我们可以安排,但是没有折扣。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "discount", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["conditional"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我很想优先帮你,可是前面还有很多订单。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们送你一年的会员。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们的补偿,希望你能接受。", "frames": [{"act": "compensate", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不是我们的错,是天气,所以不赔。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}, {"act": "compensate", "pol": "-"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "什么,你说我们送错了?我们没有送错。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "是的,我们承认,我们做得不好。", "frames": [{"act": "acknowledge", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你们那边下雪了,快递车进不去。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "weather"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "这个货断货了,工厂下周才有。", "frames": [{"act": "cause", "pol": "+", "reason": "stock"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的邮件,我已经看到了。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "老板今天出差,我先替他道歉。", "frames": [{"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你好,请问有什么需要?", "frames": [{"act": "greet", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "今天的订单很多,我们尽力。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我今天吃面条,下午去看你。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你的快递我昨天查过,没有问题。", "frames": [{"act": "deny_fault", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "你有什么要求,可以直接说。", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "没问题,我们尊重你的决定,退货。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "那你五号能收到吗?", "frames": [{"act": "ask_deadline", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "明天下午,我保证。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我今天不发,明天才发。", "frames": [{"act": "resend", "pol": "+", "when": "tomorrow"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "我们送货上门,周五。", "frames": [{"act": "promise_time", "pol": "+", "when": "friday"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "对,你是对的,抱歉。", "frames": [{"act": "agree", "pol": "+"}, {"act": "apologize", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "免你运费,而且优先寄,好吗,朋友?", "frames": [{"act": "none", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": ""}
{"text": "不会再有加急,这次是最后一次。", "frames": [{"act": "expedite", "pol": "+"}], "tags": ["learner"], "note": "这次提供加急,以后不再"}
